From e15a6554365c9f1eadcae8ab9e0a6f856ebc92bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chen Xiaohui <graych@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 15:56:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] vmm: make VM pause and resume reliable

Keep the vCPU kick signal pending outside KVM_RUN and consume it after an interrupted run, reset acknowledgements before each request, and bound vCPU state waits with monotonic deadlines. Complete each virtio resume handshake before allowing the next pause, including custom net and vhost-user worker threads and restored workers with concurrent ready events.
